WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.388 --> 00:00:07.971
(bright music)

00:00:22.699 --> 00:00:24.981
- So today we're gonna
try a new form of yoga.

00:00:24.981 --> 00:00:26.154
I don't know what it is.

00:00:26.154 --> 00:00:27.982
- I've done yoga a few times before.

00:00:27.982 --> 00:00:30.183
- I can't be still, I can't be calm.

00:00:30.183 --> 00:00:31.843
That's one of the main reasons
why I've never tried yoga.

00:00:31.843 --> 00:00:34.721
- Yoga is a really great
outlet for me to decompress.

00:00:34.721 --> 00:00:36.520
I'm excited to try it.

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:37.889
Let's do it.

00:00:37.889 --> 00:00:41.183
- So today we're gonna
surprise a group of yogis

00:00:41.183 --> 00:00:45.269
with baby goats for
what we call goat yoga.

00:00:45.269 --> 00:00:47.851
- Yoga, we kind of just integrate the mind

00:00:47.851 --> 00:00:49.403
with the body, with the breath.

00:00:49.403 --> 00:00:51.318
We did a few different
positions in the beginning

00:00:51.318 --> 00:00:54.218
that were just really
basic and really simple.

00:00:54.218 --> 00:00:57.576
- There wasn't really anything
that I haven't done before.

00:00:57.576 --> 00:00:59.155
- Nothing happened for a while,

00:00:59.155 --> 00:01:00.627
and so I just got into it.

00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:03.259
- I felt relaxed. I felt good.

00:01:03.259 --> 00:01:06.997
- [Galeit Sehayek) When you're
ready, just close your eyes

00:01:06.997 --> 00:01:09.759
Another really big thing in yoga is

00:01:09.759 --> 00:01:12.493
that we're in a constant
state of change, right?

00:01:12.493 --> 00:01:15.501
There's good things happening,
bad things happening.

00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:17.842
(laughter)

00:01:17.842 --> 00:01:20.063
Yup, that's gonna happen a lot! (laughs)

00:01:20.063 --> 00:01:22.182
It was everything I dreamed of.

00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:23.759
Goat yoga is nothing different

00:01:23.759 --> 00:01:25.785
than taking your dog for a walk.

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:27.371
You're bonding with that animal,

00:01:27.371 --> 00:01:28.901
and you're getting exercise.

00:01:28.901 --> 00:01:32.414
It's my form of the new
animal-assisted therapy.

00:01:32.414 --> 00:01:33.935
It just makes people forget all

00:01:33.935 --> 00:01:35.625
the hard things they're going through.

00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:38.748
- When we would go down, they
would jump on your backs.

00:01:38.748 --> 00:01:40.426
- I felt my muscles just relaxing

00:01:40.426 --> 00:01:42.719
with each step that they took.

00:01:42.719 --> 00:01:44.994
- Baby goats are really
just playful animals

00:01:44.994 --> 00:01:48.690
and they're not afraid
to connect with you.

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:51.440
(cheerful music)

00:01:58.645 --> 00:02:01.769
- Yoga is really good for
your mental health anyways,

00:02:01.769 --> 00:02:03.644
but adding an animal to the mix

00:02:03.644 --> 00:02:05.429
exponentially increases that.

00:02:05.429 --> 00:02:06.877
- Although I couldn't really focus

00:02:06.877 --> 00:02:09.563
on the yoga part because
the goats were just so cute,

00:02:09.563 --> 00:02:11.846
it works that way, too,
because the whole point

00:02:11.846 --> 00:02:13.634
of yoga is just to relax your mind

00:02:13.634 --> 00:02:15.613
and be happy about your surroundings,

00:02:15.613 --> 00:02:17.986
which exactly was what I was feeling.

00:02:17.986 --> 00:02:20.290
- Animals in general, they
make me feel at peace,

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:22.648
like when I pet my dog, and
just playing with those goats

00:02:22.648 --> 00:02:24.402
made me feel so good, I completely forgot

00:02:24.402 --> 00:02:25.899
about the outside world.

00:02:25.899 --> 00:02:27.634
- There should be more types of exercise

00:02:27.634 --> 00:02:29.000
incorporating animals into them

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.593
because they make us happy.
They're pure and genuine.

00:02:31.593 --> 00:02:34.120
- A lady who had breast cancer -

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:37.015
just the fact that that goat could

00:02:37.015 --> 00:02:39.690
make her happy and after all she's been

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:41.696
through, I really think there's

00:02:41.696 --> 00:02:45.863
just a healing quality about
that human-animal bond.

